    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-framework-definition",
        "moduleId": "framework-position",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定位：类库中的集合框架",
        "markdown": "教材把 Collections Framework 定位为 Java 类库中的一个重要部分。**collection（集合）** 是对一组对象（things / objects）的组织方式；只要存在这样的分组，我们通常就会希望逐个访问其中的元素，也就是**遍历（iterate over it）**。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000101"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Java's Collections Framework"
              ],
              "lineStart": 612,
              "lineEnd": 619,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "921fe9cffc43779607b0db3be8ccf4cea964f4605aa03e11b66b6b6485556c91"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-framework-analogy",
        "moduleId": "framework-position",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "模型补充：接口像标准插座",
        "markdown": "可以把这套框架想成一套标准化的容器插座：接口规定“能做什么”——放入元素、清空、判断是否为空、被遍历；具体实现类决定“内部怎么存”。调用方只依赖插座规格，就能在不同容器之间替换。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-framework-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-core-interfaces",
        "moduleId": "core-interfaces",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材说明：两个主要接口",
        "markdown": "教材指出，Collections Framework 有两个主要接口：**Iterable** 与 **Collections**（教材原文写法）。这两个接口定义了一组操作，框架中的所有类都支持它们，例如 `add(Object o)`、`clear()`、`isEmpty()` 等。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000101"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Java's Collections Framework"
              ],
              "lineStart": 612,
              "lineEnd": 619,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "921fe9cffc43779607b0db3be8ccf4cea964f4605aa03e11b66b6b6485556c91"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-interface-naming",
        "moduleId": "core-interfaces",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：接口命名的澄清",
        "markdown": "阅读 JDK 文档时要留意命名：集合的根接口是 `java.util.Collection`，而 `Collections` 是一个提供静态工具方法的类；`java.lang.Iterable` 则规定对象可以被 for-each 循环遍历。因此教材所说的“Collections 接口”，对应的应是集合根接口 `Collection`，而不是工具类 `Collections`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-core-interfaces"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-contract-value",
        "moduleId": "core-interfaces",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：统一操作换来实现可替换",
        "markdown": "统一操作的实际价值是**面向接口编程**：把方法参数声明为集合根接口或 `Iterable`，调用方就不必知道实参内部是数组、链表还是哈希结构；将来更换实现类时，调用代码无须改动。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-core-interfaces"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-iteration-and-algorithms",
        "moduleId": "iteration-and-algorithms",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材说明：要能遍历，算法可以隐藏",
        "markdown": "教材强调两点。第一，有了对象分组，通常就要能够逐个走过其中的元素，即“iterate over it”。第二，Collections Framework 允许各种算法**对使用者隐藏**地实现（implement various algorithms invisibly to the user）；教材也提示，算法本身会在后续课程中展开。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000101"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Lifecycle of an Object",
                "Java's Collections Framework"
              ],
              "lineStart": 612,
              "lineEnd": 619,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "921fe9cffc43779607b0db3be8ccf4cea964f4605aa03e11b66b6b6485556c91"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-iterator-mechanism",
        "moduleId": "iteration-and-algorithms",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：遍历通常怎样发生",
        "markdown": "“可以遍历”在 Java 中通常通过 `Iterable` 暴露一个游标对象来实现：游标依次给出下一个元素，没有元素时报告结束。遍历方式因此与容器内部的存储结构解耦，同一个 for-each 写法可以作用于不同实现。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-iteration-and-algorithms"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-algorithm-hiding",
        "moduleId": "iteration-and-algorithms",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "模型补充：隐藏算法不等于不用管代价",
        "markdown": "算法被隐藏，并不表示可以忽略代价。同样是判断“是否包含某个元素”，不同实现下的时间开销可能相差很大；框架保证的是接口一致，选择实现时仍要结合实际的访问模式。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-iteration-and-algorithms"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-framework-summary",
        "moduleId": "check-and-bridge",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "教材定义：接口与类的整体",
        "markdown": "综合来看，教材给出的定义是：Java Collections Framework 是一组**接口与类**，用来处理对象的分组，并让我们能够把各种算法的实现隐藏起来、对使用者不可见。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
